or course; an inclosing circle.
{{smaller block|That milky way,<br>Which nightly, as a circling ''zone'', thou seest<br>Powder’d with stars. {{right|''Milton'', P. L., vii. 580.}}
And four great ''zones'' of sculpture, set betwixt<br>With many a mystic symbol, gird the hall.
